{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/ef4ca7b06ad25458a481d6c23539c917.webp?t=1759275434\" width=372 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/3d0f1bc4a96359c1f76de8850d76ee5a.poster.avif?t=1759275434\" width=894 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/3d0f1bc4a96359c1f76de8850d76ee5a.webm?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/3d0f1bc4a96359c1f76de8850d76ee5a.mp4?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drop into Skiers Landing to Ski and Snowboard across huge trails, get air over wild rivers, lakes, and ruined temples, all with tight, sticky controls that add challenge and tension to every rock and tree you pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/603e3fd6c8d921cae282ccb5ef040b29.webp?t=1759275434\" width=303 height=42 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/1cd81b5da5ad59345890933a237ba44d.poster.avif?t=1759275434\" width=894 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/1cd81b5da5ad59345890933a237ba44d.webm?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/1cd81b5da5ad59345890933a237ba44d.mp4?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various game modes to choose from</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Trials - Be the fastest down the mountain, use shortcuts to your advantage and find the best way to carve down the hill in the quickest time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the Choppa - Rescue people and carry them to safety to the bottom of the hill, where a waiting Helicopter Awaits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freestyle Mode - Show off your daring with  impressive airtime. Reach the TOP of the leaderboards while landing some huge tricks and spins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/ca33579d2734d7ae42cc77d32f42124d.webp?t=1759275434\" width=333 height=42 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/4b5a5371030c28a90c50d5f4dba84680.poster.avif?t=1759275434\" width=894 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/4b5a5371030c28a90c50d5f4dba84680.webm?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/4b5a5371030c28a90c50d5f4dba84680.mp4?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock Clothing and Gear as you progress through the challenges and trials of Skiers Landing. Choose the colours that work for you and equip the gear that best suits your play style.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/1ef52de29c43d60753419c8ea44a417f.webp?t=1759275434\" width=304 height=42 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/db33fd60da9526451bd7d927aa194569.poster.avif?t=1759275434\" width=894 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/db33fd60da9526451bd7d927aa194569.webm?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/db33fd60da9526451bd7d927aa194569.mp4?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find more animals across the regions to unlock different perks for your next run. Carry them with you to help you go faster or bust bigger tricks down the mountain! Each animal helps you differently, so choose wisely for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/79f3801a02910d375d6a5c2b4a34c85c.webp?t=1759275434\" width=216 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/5fcc7136271fa172bffff369e5b0e682.poster.avif?t=1759275434\" width=894 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688270/extras/5fcc7136271fa172bffff369e5b0e682.webm?t=1759275434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse